	Node: Table
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Table: its rows (Row) in Header rows, Body rows and Footer rows, in that order, over the columns of Column sizes, its own or from a rule of Styles, which is required. When it breaks, Header rows and Footer rows are repeated on each page.
		Children:
			Child: Id
				Max: 1
			Child: Style
				Max: 1
			Child: Link
				Max: 1
			Child: Box
				Max: 1
			Child: Typography
				Max: 1
			Child: Break
				Max: 1
			Child: Column sizes
				Max: 1
			Child: Column align
				Max: 1
			Child: Gap
				Max: 1
			Child: Split rows
				Max: 1
			Child: Header rows
				Max: 1
			Child: Body rows
				Min: 1
				Max: 1
			Child: Footer rows
				Max: 1
	Node: Header rows
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Header rows of a Table: they go at the start of each page of the table.
		Children:
			Child: Row
				Min: 1
	Node: Body rows
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Body rows of a Table.
		Children:
			Child: Row
				Min: 1
	Node: Footer rows
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Footer rows of a Table: they go at the end of each page of the table.
		Children:
			Child: Row
				Min: 1
	Node: Row
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Row of a table: its cells (Cell), from left to right. It is not a layout box: its Box only accepts the appearance (Background, Border, Border color, Border style and Corner radius), which is painted as a band beneath its cells, and its Id is a link target. Its Typography is inherited by its cells, and the For style rules of its Style and For id rules of its Id apply to each of them.
		Children:
			Child: Id
				Max: 1
			Child: Style
				Max: 1
			Child: Box
				Max: 1
			Child: Typography
				Max: 1
			Child: Break
				Max: 1
			Child: Cell
				Min: 1
	Node: Cell
		Type: INLINE
		Description: Cell of a table. With a value, a one-line text box; without a value, a block with its elements (or empty).
		Children:
			Child: Id
				Max: 1
			Child: Style
				Max: 1
			Child: Link
				Max: 1
			Child: Box
				Max: 1
			Child: Typography
				Max: 1
			Child: Span
				Max: 1
			Child: Row header
