	# Groups

	Node: Box
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Box model: size, margins, padding, border (with its color and its style) and background, and what is done with what does not fit (Overflow). Not inherited.
		Children:
			Child: Width
				Max: 1
			Child: Height
				Max: 1
			Child: Min width
				Max: 1
			Child: Max width
				Max: 1
			Child: Min height
				Max: 1
			Child: Max height
				Max: 1
			Child: Aspect ratio
				Max: 1
			Child: Margin
				Max: 1
			Child: Padding
				Max: 1
			Child: Border
				Max: 1
			Child: Border color
				Max: 1
			Child: Border style
				Max: 1
			Child: Corner radius
				Max: 1
			Child: Background
				Max: 1
			Child: Overflow
				Max: 1
			Child: Merge borders
				Max: 1
	Node: Typography
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Font, code font, weight, size (and the minimum it may shrink to), line height, alignment, hyphenation, color and language of the text, heading numbering, and widows and orphans. Inherited.
		Children:
			Child: Font
				Max: 1
			Child: Code font
				Max: 1
			Child: Bold
				Max: 1
			Child: Weight
				Max: 1
			Child: Italic
				Max: 1
